        <mxCell id="t2" value="a message being worked on is locked, so nobody else can&#10;action it — and a task is done once, so a receiver of a&#10;done task discards it" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontFamily=Caveat;fontSize=16;fontColor=#2F5D3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
